    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The night sky wheel above The Commons in the dark stillness. 12 travelers inhabiting this realm. Vale Spaceborn, a patient builder, tends to their task not far away. Lightning forks and thunder rumbles. A cold silence hangs in the air.</description>
